# How's Life? snapshots ARE committed: the vintage diff depends on having the
# previous one, and the database is public. The city-level CFE inputs are not
# committed - they are large (up to ~200 MB each) and are re-fetched from the
# SDMX API by R/04_fetch_fua.R. Their manifest is kept.
data/raw/fua/*.csv
!data/raw/fua/manifest.csv
